<p>Zara sa pani<br />
Haaye<br />
Hussain Jab Key Chaley Aye Baad-e-Dopahar Ran Ko<br />
Na Tha Koi Key Jo Thaamey Rakab-e-Tousan Ko<br />
 <br />
Sakina Thaam Rahi Thee Abaa Key Daaman Ko<br />
Hussain Chup Ke Khadey Hain<br />
 <br />
(Wa Ghurbata Wa Museebata) ..(2)<br />
 <br />
1. Hussain Chup Ke Khadey Hue Hain<br />
Wa Ghurbata Wa Museebata<br />
Hussain Chup Ke Khadey hui Hain<br />
Nazar Alam Per Gadi Hui Hai<br />
(Sakina Thaamey Abaa Ka Daaman) ..(2)<br />
(Ye Apne Baba Se Keh Rahi Hay) ..(2)<br />
Aye Pyare Baba Qasam Tumhari<br />
Main Tishna Lab Hoon<br />
Zara Sa Paani<br />
(Wa Ghurbata Wa Museebata) ..(2)<br />
 <br />
 <br />
2. Chacha Se Aye Baba Jaan Keh Dein<br />
Sakina Pyasi Hai Teen Din Se<br />
(Zabaa'n Pe Kaa'nte Pade Hue Hain) ..(2)<br />
(Key Mashk Khali Hai Teen Din Se) ..(2)<br />
Lo Baba Dekho, Ye Mashk Khali<br />
Main Tishna Lab Hoon<br />
Zara Sa Paani<br />
(Wa Ghurbata Wa Museebata) ..(2)<br />
 <br />
 <br />
3. Mujhe Hai Ehsaas Mere Baba<br />
Key Ham Se Pyase Ho Tum Ziyada<br />
(Karungi Tum Se Na Phir Taqaza) ..(2)<br />
(Hai Baba Beti Ka Tum Se Wada) ..(2)<br />
Main Tum Pe Sadqey, Main Tum Pe Wari<br />
Main Tishna Lab Hoon<br />
Zara Sa Paani<br />
(Wa Ghurbata Wa Museebata)..(3)<br />
</p>